==English==

===Etymology===
{{etyl|enm}} ''maymen, mahaymen'', from {{etyl|xno}} ''maheimer, mahaigner''; see [[mayhem]].

===Pronunciation===
*: {{rhymes|eɪm}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To [[wound]] seriously; to cause permanent loss of function of a limb or part of the body.

